WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
What's more, the weather is more than 70 degrees below zero.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,880
They can't hold on for long

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,480
Flood control equipment cannot keep up

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:14,560
My body cannot adapt to such low temperatures.

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:17,000
Stay outside for half an hour continuously

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,600
There is a risk of injury

7
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:24,720
These honest people are indeed quite pitiful and hungry.

8
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:27,920
Eating is relatively simple

9
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,200
Just a plate of Olong

10
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,640
A Guerinton Steak

11
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:34,270
Plus two Huangshan sesame cakes and a bottle of Coke

12
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:35,750
Such delicious food

13
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:38,120
There are many in my space

14
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,960
Now I stay at home every day

15
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,330
Sitting in a show also becomes freer

16
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:44,330
Anyway, just sleep when you feel sleepy.

17
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:45,890
Eat when you are hungry

18
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:47,930
There is no need to distinguish between day and night
